# Preserve byte-verified native sources/manifests on every Git checkout.
# This is repository metadata; release tar archives retain their original bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.node binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
